  "custom_logic_notes": "EMAAngle uses bar [1] (previous bar) not current bar [0] for trend direction determination. When EMAAngle < -AngleThreshold: uptrend (allow BUY only if no sells). When EMAAngle > +AngleThreshold: downtrend (allow SELL only if no buys). When EMAAngle is between thresholds: flat market, no new entries. Grid logic: new BUY only if Ask is at least ExtStepGrid below lowest existing BUY open price; new SELL only if Bid is at least ExtStepGrid above highest existing SELL open price. Daily loss counter (NumberSLToday) counts deals with negative profit+commission+swap for today; if >= InpMaxLossesPerDay (3), no new trades. Lot decrease after losses: lot / InpDecreaseFactor for each day with prior losses. Time filter partially implemented: Friday 18:00+ blocks new entries, Friday 20:00+ forces all exits. Trailing stop logic is duplicated in both CheckOpenPositions and standalone Trailing() function (Trailing() is never called from OnTick). Position gate 'no_opposite_side' is enforced via EMAAngle: BUY only allowed if count_sells==0, SELL only allowed if count_buys==0.",
